-no-js-image skip-lazy" src="https://www.ocean.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/P1512942-2026-Groups-of-Students-on-Campus-RETOUCHED-scaled-960x600_c1.webp" alt="P1512942-2026-Groups-of-Students-on-Campus-RETOUCHED-scaled-960x600_c[1]" /><img decoding="async" class="soliloquy-image soliloquy-no-js-image skip-lazy" src="https://www.ocean.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/P1512965-2026-Groups-of-Students-on-Campus-RETOUCHED-scaled-960x600_c1.webp" alt="P1512965-2026-Groups-of-Students-on-Campus-RETOUCHED-scaled-960x600_c[1]" /><img decoding="async" class="soliloquy-image soliloquy-no-js-image skip-lazy" src="https://www.ocean.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/P1512972-2026-Groups-of-Students-on-Campus-RETOUCHED-scaled-960x600_c1.webp" alt="P1512972-2026-Groups-of-Students-on-Campus-RETOUCHED-scaled-960x600_c[1]" /></div></noscript></div></div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33.33%">
<div style="height:10px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer LessSpace"></div>



<p class="is-style-intro LessSpace wp-block-paragraph">Vibrant energy, community connections, and meaningful campus traditions define autumn at Ocean County College.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Over the past few weeks, our campus has been alive with activity, from the excitement of Fall Fest and Halloween celebrations to the community spirit of the &#8216;See Me&#8217; walk and the festive Trunk or Treat hosted by our Enrollment Services team for local families. We came together to honor the service and sacrifice of our military community during our Veterans Day commemoration. Students and staff gathered for a profound and moving presentation by Holocaust survivor Norbert Strauss, reminding us of the powerful historical perspectives we share in our classrooms. </p>
</div>
</div>



